  "title": "SB 513 (2005-2006 Regular Session, Michigan Legislature (bill page title: \"Senate Bill 513 of 2005 ( Public Act 71 of 2005 )\")): Elections; other; use of digitized signatures and general amendments to Michigan election law; provide for. Amends secs. 31, 301, 302, 312, 370, 381, 476, 498, 500b, 501, 507, 509m, 509q, 509gg, 523, 552, 641, 642a, 653a, 699, 761, 766, 767, 792a, 961, 961a & 963 of 1954 PA 116 (MCL 168.31 et seq.); adds secs. 302a & 509hh & repeals secs. 500g & 501a of 1954 PA 116 (MCL 168.500g & 168.501a).",
